  <notes>Spec FR-04 (graceful-degradation guarantee); plan.md §5 Phase 2. The exact NDA breakers — MUST NOT 422. Builds on 020; the no-422 behavior is asserted broadly in 027. Version history (FR-07) is the safety net for flattened content. parallel-safe=false. Run /conflict-check before the BFF PR.</notes>

